00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.770
It absolutely does wake you up.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.200
You know what wakes you up more
than a slap, a sternal rub.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.210
We actually do that in the
hospital to our patients.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.340
The sternum is a bone.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.200
If you rub it very aggressively like that,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.240
it'll wake a patient up.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.770
That's how we check if
they're actually unconscious

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.420
or awake or just asleep.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.633
