00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.630
Why does your funny bone
tingle when you touch it

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.600
or whatever?

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.380
Well, if yours tingles
just when you touch it,

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.213
there's a problem.

00:05:10.213 --> 00:05:12.270
There's some inflammation
in your cubital fossa.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.560
In your cubital tunnel.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.950
I'm fossa everywhere today.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.320
In your cubital tunnel here.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.930
When you hit your funny bone,

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.420
here's what's actually happening,

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.760
and I'm going to blow your mind right now,

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.760
'cause the funny bone ain't even a bone.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.430
It's actually the ulnar nerve

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.420
that runs in the cubital tunnel here

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.960
that leaves your spine,
comes down your arm,

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.770
and comes and give sensation

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.610
and motor control to your hand.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:35.980
And unlike regular pain,

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.000
which is like achy, throbby, sharp,

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.830
nerve pain, like if you
damage the nerve directly,

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.650
what you're getting is electrical,
shooting, awkward pain,

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.010
tingly that feels weird.

