00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.760
Why is it when you smell
something really bad,

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:34.930
it makes you want to throw up?

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:38.580
That's probably an evolutionary
thing that you've developed

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.310
to make you stay away from that object,

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.500
'cause nausea's a very powerful deterrent.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.650
If it's already in your mouth,

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.560
why you throw up is because your body

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:48.010
probably senses something is amok there

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.700
and shouldn't be entering your body,

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.390
and actually encourages
you to get rid of it.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.530
Can a person with epilepsy
still work in the hospital?

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.363
Absolutely.

00:06:54.363 --> 00:06:55.196
It obviously depends

00:06:55.196 --> 00:06:56.900
