susceptibility of colds

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.430
because if you are very cold
and aren't dressed right,

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.800
that can hurt your immune system.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.240
Also in the winter time,
the air is more dry,

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.140
therefore drying out your mucus membranes.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.430
And the fun part that I
like to talk about most

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.460
is germ hang time.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.160
When the air is dry,
you sneeze into the air,

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.610
the germs hang around a lot longer.

