00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.500
as opposed to reading
nonsense articles online

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.920
that usually doesn't apply to you.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.210
Why is it when you get up
too fast you get lightheaded?

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.070
All right, fun question about
orthostatic hypotension.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.910
Your body has a blood pressure
that it needs to maintain

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.210
in order to keep blood going

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.390
from the lower part of
your body against gravity

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:38.710
and feeding your brain, right?

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:39.780
'Cause your brain's at the top,

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.600
gravity's pulling your blood down.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.750
When you stand up,

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.540
you suddenly need to raise your
blood pressure very quickly

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.430
in order to make sure

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.080
that the blood keeps reaching the brain.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.250
So what your body has to do

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.650
is that's the sense that change
of pressure really quickly

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.220
and adjust by squeezing
the arteries in your legs

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.580
in order to shoot that blood
back up into your brain.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:59.310
Now, now, now, now, now, now,

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.540
if you're a little bit older,
if you're a little dehydrated,

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.210
and you can't maintain a
good enough blood pressure

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.230
or you can't adjust your
blood pressure as quickly,

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.740
you will feel a little
lightheaded when you get up

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.190
and that's why you should get up slowly

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.250
and you should always have support

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.150
and make sure you don't fall.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.580
How do you know if you
have high blood pressure?

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.730
